            <p>Він зв’язує public marketing signals із diagnostic, CRM attribution, qualified lead actions, консультаціями, sales outcomes, delivery та retention через визначені evidence/source rules. It connects public marketing signals to a diagnostic, CRM attribution, qualified lead actions, consultations, sales outcomes, delivery, and retention using defined evidence and source rules.</p>
